# Written by hand (ADR 0050): clicking roads to change their class while cars drive. A street
# becomes a main road, a click with the same class and one off every road are refused, a main
# road becomes a street, and another street is upgraded.
sim-game command log 1
seed 1
grid 4 4
0 spawn 60
50 fill 50 50 residential-low
300 class 175 124 main
300 class 175 124 main
600 class 76 6 street
900 class 296 111 main
900 class 600 600 main
end 3000
expect hash af9ae85a46205f11 population 21 buildings 11 trips 110
